{"ts": 0.034014, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[3J\u001b[H\u001b[2J", "len": 11}
{"ts": 0.035375, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m──\u001b[0m \u001b[93mshelltutor\u001b[0m \u001b[90m──\u001b[0m \u001b[90mStage 4 · Commands and streams\u001b[0m \u001b[90m───────────────────────\u001b[0m \u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[93m◉\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m \u001b[90m──\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 250}
{"ts": 0.035452, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\r\n", "len": 2}
{"ts": 0.035477, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;97mStage 4: Commands and streams\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nSix short lessons, then a task. You'll read a command's parts, then\r\njoin commands together and send what they print into files.\r\nThis stage runs in its own folder, stage4, with a few files the tutor put\r\nthere; \u001b[92mpwd\u001b[0m shows it.\r\n\r\n\u001b[93m▶ Type \u001b[92mnext\u001b[93m for lesson 4.1.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 334}
{"ts": 0.03861, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;90mnext\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mshow\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mprev\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mquit\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 71}
{"ts": 0.038858, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 251}
{"ts": 0.038878, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\r\n", "len": 2}
{"ts": 0.051283, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[?2004hshelltutor> ", "len": 20}
{"ts": 0.051377, "dir": "in", "enc": "utf8", "data": "next\n", "len": 5}
{"ts": 0.051404, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "next\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r", "len": 15}
{"ts": 0.055755, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[3J\u001b[H\u001b[2J", "len": 11}
{"ts": 0.056887, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m──\u001b[0m \u001b[90mStage 4 · Commands and streams\u001b[0m \u001b[90m────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m \u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[93m◉\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m  \u001b[93m4.1\u001b[0m \u001b[90m──\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 255}
{"ts": 0.056919, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\r\n", "len": 2}
{"ts": 0.056982, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;97mThe parts of a command\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nA command line is a name, then options, then arguments.\r\n", "len": 94}
{"ts": 0.057012, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\r\n  \u001b[92mwc -l poem.txt\u001b[0m         \u001b[90m# name wc, option -l, argument poem.txt\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mecho \"hello world\"\u001b[0m     \u001b[90m# one argument, because of the quotes\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mcommand -v vim\u001b[0m         \u001b[90m# asks where a program lives, if it exists\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[92mcommand -v\u001b[0m prints a path when the program is installed, and nothing\r\nwhen it is not.\r\n\r\n\u001b[93m▶ Try all three, then type \u001b[92mnext\u001b[93m.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 411}
{"ts": 0.060029, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;90mnext\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mshow\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mprev\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mquit\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 71}
{"ts": 0.060303, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 253}
{"ts": 0.073812, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[?2004hshelltutor> ", "len": 20}
{"ts": 0.073939, "dir": "in", "enc": "utf8", "data": "wc -l poem.txt\n", "len": 15}
{"ts": 0.073973, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "wc -l poem.txt\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r", "len": 25}
{"ts": 0.076493, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "       4 poem.txt\r\n", "len": 19}
{"ts": 0.076807, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[?2004hshelltutor> ", "len": 20}
{"ts": 0.076863, "dir": "in", "enc": "utf8", "data": "echo \"hello world\"\n", "len": 19}
{"ts": 0.076911, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "echo \"hello world\"\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r", "len": 29}
{"ts": 0.07693, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "hello world\r\n", "len": 13}
{"ts": 0.077014, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[?2004hshelltutor> ", "len": 20}
{"ts": 0.077045, "dir": "in", "enc": "utf8", "data": "command -v vim\n", "len": 15}
{"ts": 0.077086, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "command -v vim\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r", "len": 25}
{"ts": 0.077172, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "/usr/bin/vim\r\n", "len": 14}
{"ts": 0.077248, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[?2004hshelltutor> ", "len": 20}
{"ts": 0.077273, "dir": "in", "enc": "utf8", "data": "next\n", "len": 5}
{"ts": 0.077296, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "next\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r", "len": 15}
{"ts": 0.082155, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[3J\u001b[H\u001b[2J", "len": 11}
{"ts": 0.083467, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m──\u001b[0m \u001b[90mStage 4 · Commands and streams\u001b[0m \u001b[90m────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m \u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[93m◉\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m  \u001b[93m4.2\u001b[0m \u001b[90m──\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 255}
{"ts": 0.083496, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\r\n", "len": 2}
{"ts": 0.083555, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;97mSpaces and quotes\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nThe shell splits a line on spaces. Quote a name that has a space.\r\n", "len": 99}
{"ts": 0.083582, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\r\n  \u001b[92mtouch my notes.txt\u001b[0m       \u001b[90m# two files: my, and notes.txt\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mls\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mtouch \"my notes.txt\"\u001b[0m     \u001b[90m# one file with a space in its name\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mls\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nIt is the same for every command: \u001b[92mvim my notes.txt\u001b[0m would open two\r\nfiles; \u001b[92mvim \"my notes.txt\"\u001b[0m opens one.\r\n\r\n\u001b[93m▶ Try them, then type \u001b[92mnext\u001b[93m.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 370}
{"ts": 0.086737, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;90mnext\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mshow\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mprev\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mquit\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 71}
{"ts": 0.087008, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 253}
