{"ts": 0.114647, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m──\u001b[0m \u001b[90mStage 4 · Commands and streams\u001b[0m \u001b[90m────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m \u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[93m◉\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m  \u001b[93m4.3\u001b[0m \u001b[90m──\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 255}
{"ts": 0.114687, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\r\n", "len": 2}
{"ts": 0.114755, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;97mThe pipe\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nWhat a command prints is a stream of lines. A pipe, \u001b[92m|\u001b[0m, sends that stream\r\ninto the next command.\r\n\r\n", "len": 132}
{"ts": 0.114784, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "  \u001b[92mseq 1 100 | wc -l\u001b[0m              \u001b[90m# seq prints 1 to 100; wc -l counts the lines\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mls /usr/bin | wc -l\u001b[0m            \u001b[90m# how many programs live there\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mls /usr/bin | sort | head\u001b[0m      \u001b[90m# pipes stack: list, sort, first ten\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nEach piece is an ordinary command. Only the connector is new. \u001b[92m|\u001b[0m is\r\n\u001b[1mShift+Backslash\u001b[0m.\r\n\r\n\u001b[93m▶ Try all three, then type \u001b[92mnext\u001b[93m.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 434}
{"ts": 0.117979, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;90mnext\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mshow\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mprev\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mquit\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 71}
{"ts": 0.118238, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 253}
{"ts": 0.130412, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[?2004hshelltutor> ", "len": 20}
{"ts": 0.13049, "dir": "in", "enc": "utf8", "data": "seq 1 100 | wc -l\n", "len": 18}
{"ts": 0.130522, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "seq 1 100 | wc -l\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r", "len": 28}
{"ts": 0.132837, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "     100\r\n", "len": 10}
{"ts": 0.133131, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[?2004h", "len": 8}
