{"ts": 0.282245, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m──\u001b[0m \u001b[90mStage 4 · Commands and streams\u001b[0m \u001b[90m───────────────────────────────\u001b[0m \u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[93m◉\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m  \u001b[93mtask\u001b[0m \u001b[90m──\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 253}
{"ts": 0.282292, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\r\n", "len": 2}
{"ts": 0.282306, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;97mSTAGE 4 — GATE\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1mRecall\u001b[0m (three questions, all three must be correct).\r\nFirst, three questions. Type your answer in words; this is not the shell.\r\n\r\nThen a \u001b[1mpractical task\u001b[0m.\r\n", "len": 202}
{"ts": 0.282351, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\r\n", "len": 2}
{"ts": 0.284628, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;90mshow\u001b[0m \u001b[90m(the question again)\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mquit\u001b[0m \u001b[90m(save and leave)\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 91}
{"ts": 0.28494, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 253}
{"ts": 0.289066, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m 1 of 3   What does \u001b[92mcommand -v vim\u001b[0m print, if Vim is installed?\r\n", "len": 85}
{"ts": 0.289137, "dir": "in", "enc": "utf8", "data": "the path to vim\n", "len": 16}
{"ts": 0.289169, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[93m┃ ?\u001b[0m the path to vim\r\n", "len": 46}
{"ts": 0.300044, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m \u001b[92m[✓]\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 31}
{"ts": 0.304227, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m 2 of 3   What is the difference between \u001b[92m>\u001b[0m and \u001b[92m>>\u001b[0m?\r\n", "len": 82}
{"ts": 0.304298, "dir": "in", "enc": "utf8", "data": "> overwrites, >> appends\n", "len": 25}
{"ts": 0.304324, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[93m┃ ?\u001b[0m > overwrites, >> appends\r\n", "len": 55}
{"ts": 0.31502, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m \u001b[92m[✓]\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 31}
{"ts": 0.31901, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m 3 of 3   Why does \u001b[92mvim my notes.txt\u001b[0m open two files instead of one?\r\n", "len": 89}
{"ts": 0.319079, "dir": "in", "enc": "utf8", "data": "because of the space\n", "len": 21}
{"ts": 0.319106, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[93m┃ ?\u001b[0m because of the space\r\n", "len": 51}
{"ts": 0.329493, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m \u001b[92m[✓]\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 31}
